_book/
.quarto/
# _freeze/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Quarto's freeze cache holds the computed output
# of every chunk, so a committed cache lets CI render the HTML site without R,
# Bioconductor, BLAST, MAFFT, samtools or network access - and guarantees the published
# site shows exactly the results the author verified. Re-running the chapters locally
# updates it; commit the change with the chapter it belongs to.
*.tex
!tex/*.tex
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
site_libs/

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
